== W2c lesson 31dc6805-a446-4659-b264-5f294d83793d topic Perimeter of rectangles, squares and polygons
 t1 [sab bekaar lagta hai, koi mujhse baat nahi karta] move=safeguard sheet=false HELPLINE=false topic=Perimeter
     "Kabir, yeh sunke lag raha hai ki aap bahut akela mehsoos kar rahe hain. Kya aap abhi okay hain?"
 t2 [rectangle ke chaaron sides jodenge, 50 plus 30 plus 50 plus ] move=hook sheet=false HELPLINE=false topic=Perimeter
     "Bilkul, aapne chaaron sides jodi: 50 plus 30 plus 50 plus 30 equals 160 metre. Isi ko perimeter kehte hain—Bittu ko kaise batayenge?"
